{"type":"text","timestamp":1794383442082,"sessionID":"ses_e3672e1a6ffehdb0VczbWI4BJw","part":{"id":"prt_1c9967087001SLcZ9pu88WZ2ey","messageID":"msg_1c9962da7001hJ4Bwn0tkb7VHs","sessionID":"ses_e3672e1a6ffehdb0VczbWI4BJw","type":"text","text":"The app is complete. Here's a summary of what was built:\n\n## Backend (`backend/app.py`)\n- Flask API with SQLite storage under `./data/app.db` (persists across restarts).\n- **Auth**: `POST /api/auth/register` (201, returns token), `POST /api/auth/login` (200, returns token). Bearer-token auth via `Authorization` header; protected routes answer 401.\n- **Tracks**: `GET /api/tracks` (paged, `q`/`page`/`page_size`, newest first), `POST /api/tracks` (signed-in, validates `http`/`https` URLs), `GET /api/tracks/{id}`, `DELETE /api/tracks/{id}` (owner-only, 403 otherwise), `POST /api/tracks/{id}/plays` (increments `play_count`).\n- Serves the React build at `/` with SPA fallback, plus `GET /api/health`.\n\n## Frontend (`frontend/`)\n- React + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS v4 (via `@tailwindcss/vite`, single `index.css` entry — no hand-written CSS).\n- Registration/sign-in forms with the signed-in username and sign-out.\n- Track list (title, artist, duration, play count) with search, paging, and play buttons.\n- Player bar: play/pause, seek, volume, current title/artist, next/previous through the list, and `play_count` recording on play start.\n- Add-track form surfacing API validation messages; delete with confirmation on the current user's own tracks.\n\n## Verification\n- Full API test suite passed (register/login, auth enforcement, URL validation, paging, search, play count, ownership checks, 404s).\n- `npm ci && npm run build` succeeds; `gunicorn` serves `/`, SPA routes, and `/api/health`.\n- Added `.gitignore` for `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `data/`, and Python caches.\n\nNote: I pinned the new frontend deps into `package.json`/`package-lock.json` via `npm install`; the backend `requirements.lock` already covered Flask/gunicorn (no backend dependency changes).","time":{"start":1794383442055,"end":1794383442058}}}
